00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:18,080
And all right, well, I can't prove you're wrong,

249
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:21,760
but that seems a very strange view about how the world works,

250
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:23,680
that lots of other people are going

251
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:26,040
to noticeably change their driving just because you're not

252
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,480
driving that well.

253
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,400
Seems kind of fanciful.

254
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:29,960
All right.

255
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:32,920
So we have lots of kinds of examples of this thinking.

